1
00:00:39,936 --> 00:00:45,632
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,048 --> 00:00:48,544
=Episode 11=

3
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,200
How is Wangshu?

4
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:58,280
The General said

5
00:00:59,039 --> 00:01:02,159
send her straight to Master Zhang.
Take her away.

6
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,560
I'm not going!

7
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:05,840
Let go of me!

8
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:13,680
Who's there?

9
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,000
You dare break into the Yue camp?

10
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:29,600
♪Tears fall where blizzards rage♪

11
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,719
Lady Xingyao, let's go!

12
00:01:37,728 --> 00:01:42,208
♪Hard to tell whose sorrow cuts deeper♪

13
00:01:42,432 --> 00:01:49,056
♪Does deeper pain leave a lasting mark♪

14
00:01:49,376 --> 00:01:51,136
♪Too much left owed♪

15
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:52,040
- Are you alright?
- You're hurt.

16
00:01:52,959 --> 00:01:53,760
- I'm fine.
- I'm fine.

17
00:01:55,744 --> 00:01:57,664
♪Willing to drown in this vortex♪

18
00:01:57,664 --> 00:02:01,504
♪Never seeking escape♪

19
00:02:06,359 --> 00:02:07,000
Qiyang,

20
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,879
she is your sister after all.

21
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,319
You shouldn't torture her.

22
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:14,520
She was so heartless to you,

23
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,840
yet you still defend her?

24
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,560
Should I take this up with your father,

25
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:20,039
to see

26
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,879
if her fate ends up even worse?

27
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,000
The Young Lord has spoken.

28
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,639
Talk while you still can.

29
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:32,704
It'll make your death far less painful.

30
00:02:51,456 --> 00:02:56,031
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

31
00:02:56,806 --> 00:03:01,303
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

32
00:03:04,542 --> 00:03:09,664
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

33
00:03:09,664 --> 00:03:13,003
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

34
00:03:13,003 --> 00:03:14,367
♪Refusing to forget♪

35
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:22,591
♪If fate tears us apart♪

36
00:03:23,095 --> 00:03:28,814
♪I will gamble against heaven itself♪

37
00:03:28,814 --> 00:03:32,416
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

38
00:03:32,416 --> 00:03:35,933
♪Calamity fire
burns away all evil spirits♪

39
00:03:35,952 --> 00:03:39,087
♪You are a drop of blood upon my heart♪

40
00:03:39,087 --> 00:03:42,838
♪I am a wound etched into your palm♪

41
00:03:42,838 --> 00:03:46,312
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

42
00:03:46,312 --> 00:03:49,573
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

43
00:03:49,914 --> 00:03:52,803
♪Wind and snow bear witness,
this heart was not in vain♪

44
00:03:52,803 --> 00:03:55,808
♪With you here♪

45
00:03:55,808 --> 00:03:59,077
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

46
00:03:59,077 --> 00:04:02,272
♪Calamity fire
burns away all evil spirits♪

47
00:04:02,662 --> 00:04:05,639
♪You are a drop of blood upon my heart♪

48
00:04:05,639 --> 00:04:06,439
I'm sorry.

49
00:04:07,439 --> 00:04:08,240
I'm so sorry.

50
00:04:10,016 --> 00:04:12,928
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

51
00:04:12,928 --> 00:04:15,776
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

52
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:16,839
Lizhi.

53
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,279
I'm sorry.

54
00:04:24,079 --> 00:04:24,959
I'm so sorry.

55
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,040
Why didn't tell them you met me?

56
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,199
When I was in the Loong Abyss,

57
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:34,920
I gave you my word.

58
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:37,439
Does it hurt?

59
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,600
Does it hurt?

60
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,480
Stop right there!

61
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:48,639
So you're her secret lover?

62
00:04:49,439 --> 00:04:51,680
What a shameless pair of wretches!

63
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,439
It was you

64
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,560
who hurt her?

65
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:14,759
What kind of sorcery is this?

66
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:17,079
I am General Zhenbei!

67
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:18,680
Hurting me

68
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:21,639
means crossing
the entire General's Manor

69
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:24,199
and defying the law itself!

70
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,279
And you,

71
00:05:25,639 --> 00:05:26,759
Yue Wangshu!

72
00:05:27,319 --> 00:05:28,600
You shameless wretch,

73
00:05:28,879 --> 00:05:30,040
colluding with an outsider,

74
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,879
turning against your own kin!

75
00:05:32,439 --> 00:05:33,560
My mother

76
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,600
should have drowned you back then!

77
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,199
Lizhi!

78
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:01,952
Wangshu!

79
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:03,519
Xingyao, stay back!

80
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,759
Take her up.

81
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:14,839
I won't stop you.

82
00:06:15,439 --> 00:06:16,680
But My Lord, you cannot

83
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,240
let her expose your identity.

84
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,560
The Li Fire is your strength.

85
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:21,759
Lose control of it,

86
00:06:22,079 --> 00:06:23,240
and it becomes your weakness.

87
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:26,959
I just don't want
to see you die over this.

88
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:29,120
Lizhi, stop!

89
00:06:42,656 --> 00:06:44,672
♪If love were a noun♪

90
00:06:45,216 --> 00:06:47,872
♪Woven with pain♪

91
00:06:48,256 --> 00:06:53,216
♪I softly murmur your name
between heartbeats♪

92
00:06:54,048 --> 00:06:59,616
♪As ripples stir
in the corner of our eyes♪

93
00:06:59,616 --> 00:07:05,248
♪Wherever our gazes meet,
passion settles♪

94
00:07:05,504 --> 00:07:08,384
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

95
00:07:08,384 --> 00:07:10,592
♪Take root after drowning♪

96
00:07:11,072 --> 00:07:16,544
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

97
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:22,176
♪Step by step, inch by inch,
tracing your silhouette♪

98
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:27,744
♪A rouge-tinted letter
brings a distant lover close♪

99
00:07:27,936 --> 00:07:33,088
♪Torn apart by time,
regrets still intertwine♪

100
00:07:33,696 --> 00:07:39,040
♪We hope to meet, but won't confess♪

101
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:44,864
♪You're the one I wish to hold
through every page and scene♪

102
00:07:44,864 --> 00:07:54,016
♪A single tear
burns love and hate to ashes♪

103
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:57,952
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

104
00:07:57,952 --> 00:08:00,224
♪Take root after drowning♪

105
00:08:00,896 --> 00:08:06,016
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

106
00:08:06,368 --> 00:08:11,904
♪Step by step, inch by inch,
tracing your silhouette♪

107
00:08:12,096 --> 00:08:17,472
♪A rouge-tinted letter
brings a distant lover close♪

108
00:08:17,696 --> 00:08:22,656
♪Torn apart by time,
regrets still intertwine♪

109
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:23,800
Let's go.

110
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:28,352
♪We hope to meet, but won't confess♪

111
00:08:28,992 --> 00:08:34,208
♪You're the one I wish to hold
through every page and scene♪

112
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:39,840
Lizhi,

113
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:41,919
return to the Loong Abyss.

114
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,000
Lizhi.

115
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:47,519
Lizhi!

116
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:57,720
Lizhi.

117
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:08,879
Lizhi.

118
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:13,760
Lizhi.

119
00:09:14,279 --> 00:09:14,880
Lizhi.

120
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,759
Don't scare me, Lizhi.

121
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,759
Lizhi!

122
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,480
Lizhi.

123
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:48,960
Lizhi.

124
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:58,320
It's our wedding day.

125
00:09:58,519 --> 00:10:00,000
He heard Yue Wangshu was alive

126
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,120
and ran straight to her.

127
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,320
Mother, why did you stop me?

128
00:10:03,519 --> 00:10:05,200
I'll tear that wretch to pieces myself!

129
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:06,960
Mother!

130
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:09,080
You're making a spectacle of yourself.

131
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:11,600
Haven't you been humiliated enough?

132
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,039
As for Yue Wangshu,

133
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,639
Qiyang's already on it.

134
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,200
Running from her own wedding

135
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:19,240
is a capital offense on its own.

136
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,399
Zhu Heng couldn't protect her then,

137
00:10:21,519 --> 00:10:22,159
and now,

138
00:10:22,559 --> 00:10:23,584
he can't do it either!

139
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,639
Madam, My Lady,

140
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:26,600
Master Qiyang...

141
00:10:27,039 --> 00:10:27,744
Yang!

142
00:10:28,039 --> 00:10:28,600
Qiyang!

143
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:32,120
What happened?

144
00:10:32,399 --> 00:10:33,279
Who did this?

145
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,320
Speak!

146
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,080
Madam, the Young Lord ordered

147
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,600
that no one is to speak a word

148
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,200
of today's camp affairs.

149
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:40,879
Violators will be executed.

150
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,519
Does it hurt?

151
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,960
Not at all. Just a scratch.

152
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:08,919
Thank you for saving me today, My Lord.
Also...

153
00:11:09,519 --> 00:11:10,320
I'll take care

154
00:11:10,759 --> 00:11:11,879
what comes next.

155
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,919
Today's events are to be recorded

156
00:11:14,759 --> 00:11:16,759
as a rare avalanche phenomenon.

157
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,039
No one else will ever know

158
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:27,799
of Mister Lizhi.

159
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:30,759
But Zhu Heng...

160
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,120
Young Lord Zhu was there.

161
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,480
His father

162
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,159
and the Yue family

163
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,279
held a ritual

164
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,519
under the Loong Lord's name.

165
00:11:40,399 --> 00:11:41,000
Yet in the end,

166
00:11:41,279 --> 00:11:42,440
they enraged the true loong.

167
00:11:42,759 --> 00:11:44,879
If this scandal ever gets out,

168
00:11:45,759 --> 00:11:47,080
how would His Majesty view them?

169
00:11:49,919 --> 00:11:50,840
Having offended

170
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,000
the Loong Lord,

171
00:11:52,519 --> 00:11:53,679
would Prince Qi's supporters

172
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,360
remain loyal?

173
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:58,720
He wants this

174
00:11:59,919 --> 00:12:01,360
kept quiet even more than me.

175
00:12:06,039 --> 00:12:06,720
Thank you, My Lord.

176
00:12:07,879 --> 00:12:09,320
Just call me Master Wei Xun.

177
00:12:09,639 --> 00:12:11,080
I didn't mean to hide my identity.

178
00:12:13,159 --> 00:12:13,840
It was just

179
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,399
for convenience.

180
00:12:16,679 --> 00:12:17,720
I hope you'll understand.

181
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:27,919
Now,

182
00:12:28,519 --> 00:12:30,039
Lady Xingyao, could you tell me

183
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:31,600
what really happened?

184
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,519
That day at Chunfeng Pavilion,

185
00:12:34,399 --> 00:12:36,399
the mystic art he used to save me

186
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,080
already caught my attention.

187
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:39,720
It's just...

188
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,240
My Lord,

189
00:12:41,559 --> 00:12:42,360
about him,

190
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,320
if my sister won't say,

191
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:45,919
neither can I.

192
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:48,919
I got it.

193
00:12:53,759 --> 00:12:55,039
Take these herbs with you.

194
00:12:55,519 --> 00:12:56,759
Change them twice a day.

195
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:57,960
If anything is off,

196
00:12:58,679 --> 00:12:59,679
send for me anytime.

197
00:13:00,759 --> 00:13:01,840
Then can I come every day

198
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:03,080
to get it dressed?

199
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:11,919
Just kidding.

200
00:13:13,279 --> 00:13:14,360
Get some rest.

201
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:15,679
Near the cottage,

202
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:17,159
I'll post some guards.

203
00:13:17,679 --> 00:13:18,639
Thank you, My Lord.

204
00:13:21,919 --> 00:13:22,720
My Lord,

205
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:28,879
take care as well.

206
00:14:32,559 --> 00:14:33,159
Wangshu,

207
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:37,320
what really happened?

208
00:14:38,639 --> 00:14:39,919
Halfway there,

209
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:43,440
he just fell from the sky.

210
00:14:44,559 --> 00:14:45,759
He has never been like this.

211
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,240
He showed his loong form.

212
00:14:47,919 --> 00:14:49,399
I fear this will cause an uproar.

213
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:50,559
Besides,

214
00:14:52,279 --> 00:14:53,399
Yue Qiyang was...

215
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,480
Zhu Heng locked down the news.

216
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,039
The soldiers won't dare speak,

217
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,480
Yue Qiyang can't speak,

218
00:15:00,879 --> 00:15:02,639
and Lord Wei Xun
has made his arrangements.

219
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,360
So,

220
00:15:07,279 --> 00:15:09,159
he is the Loong Lord?

221
00:15:11,519 --> 00:15:12,320
Why not tell me?

222
00:15:13,399 --> 00:15:14,240
He wouldn't allow it.

223
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:15,759
I gave him my word.

224
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,279
He brought me back to you,

225
00:15:19,559 --> 00:15:21,080
and I wouldn't reveal his identity.

226
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:22,360
So

227
00:15:23,759 --> 00:15:25,159
did you know he'd lose control?

228
00:15:25,559 --> 00:15:27,519
He'll be fine with me here.

229
00:15:32,159 --> 00:15:32,759
Wait.

230
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:36,919
What is this?

231
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:41,080
What's your agreement with him
really about?

232
00:15:41,519 --> 00:15:43,519
Is this what you meant by helping him?

233
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:44,879
I...

234
00:15:46,759 --> 00:15:47,519
Xingyao,

235
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,000
don't worry.

236
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,559
He won't hurt me.

237
00:16:00,639 --> 00:16:02,360
(Wangshu, you're exhausted.)

238
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,960
(I can only blend some calming incense)

239
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,759
(to get you some good sleep.)

240
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,240
(Rest well.)

241
00:16:44,256 --> 00:16:48,831
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

242
00:16:49,606 --> 00:16:54,103
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

243
00:16:57,342 --> 00:17:02,464
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

244
00:17:02,464 --> 00:17:05,803
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

245
00:17:05,803 --> 00:17:07,167
♪Refusing to forget♪

246
00:17:10,833 --> 00:17:15,610
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

247
00:17:16,161 --> 00:17:17,951
♪He cannot learn them♪

248
00:17:17,951 --> 00:17:21,086
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

249
00:17:24,238 --> 00:17:26,562
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

250
00:17:26,562 --> 00:17:28,925
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

251
00:17:29,503 --> 00:17:32,167
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

252
00:17:32,167 --> 00:17:33,925
♪Their days ahead are long♪
